4 Fuel up_1 Listen and chant","chapters":["Unit 1 I love sports","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-TX-01.1"],"align":[["EN-S1-TX-01.1","T","Listen and chant.","book",13],["EN-S1-LC-01.3","P","Hear it, say it","book",13],["EN-S1-TH-01.13","P","Sports Day! Sports Day！","book",13]]},{"id":"cd9f71cd-c9dc-aa79-e62a-f6e5d6ee6bc2","title":"Unit 1_4 Fuel up_3 Listen and write","chapters":["Unit 1 I love sports","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.11","EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","She can play ping-pong well.","book",14],["EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Listen and write.","book",14],["EN-S1-LA-03.1","P","Work in pairs.","book",14]],"goals":{"take":"听录音并在句子框中写出关于能力的完整句子，能与同伴合作完成填写任务。","later":"","items":[["学生能在听两遍录音的情境中，根据所给句型和提示，写出完整的能力句子（如 She can play ping-pong well）。",["EN-S1-LK-01.11","EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"运用所学语法知识描述人和物","能准确写出与录音对应的句子，如 She can play ping-pong well。"],["学生能在两人一组的练习中分工听写并互相检查，纠正一处以上错写的单词或短语。",["EN-S1-LS-01.3","EN-S1-LA-03.1"],"有目的地提取","两人互查并指出并改正同伴至少一个错误。"]]}},{"id":"028deb4e-dbfe-a07d-bd24-91bd0881d836","title":"Unit 1_5 Words and expressions","chapters":["Unit 1 I love sports","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.7","T","Ability: She can","book",14],["EN-S1-LS-01.3","P","Listen and write.","book",14]],"goals":{"take":"根据图片或听觉提示，说出并书写本课目标短语，能完成听写练习。","later":"","items":[["学生能根据课本图片或教师示范动作，说出与 Ability: She can 相关的单词或短语（发音与词形基本正确）。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"说出单词和短语","能在看图后口头说出并正确拼写该单词或短语。"],["学生能在听录音并对照图片后，填写听写表格中的单词或短语，字母顺序与拼写基本正确。",["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"有目的地提取","听写表格中所填词汇拼写正确率达到约80%。"]]}},{"id":"73b55e08-e36d-da5e-3d52-7aaddcd97ad8","title":"Unit 1 I love sports (Hit it big)","chapters":["Unit 1 I love sports","Hit it big"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.11","EN-S1-TQ-02.1"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","use “can” and \"can't\" to talk about abilities； talk about sp","book",17],["EN-S1-TQ-02.1","T","Do a class survey about sports","book",15],["EN-S1-LA-03.1","P","Work in groups","book",16]],"goals":{"take":"用 can / can't 在班级调查与小组交流中陈述和记录同学的运动能力，并归纳出简单结果。","later":"更复杂的数据分析与书面报告留到后续课完成","items":[["学生能在小组内用句型 can/can't 向同学提问并记录答案（例如：Can you swim? Yes, I can. / No, I can't.）。",["EN-S1-LK-01.11"],"进行简单交流","能用 can/can't 完成至少5次问答并把回答记录在表格中。"],["学生能根据小组或班级调查的图片或关键词，归纳并口头报告1–2条调查结果（如 Most classmates can play basketball）。",["EN-S1-TQ-02.1"],"归纳语篇","能在小组汇报时说出一条调查归纳结论并给出简单支持语。"],["学生能在小组合作活动中分工完成调查、记录与汇报任务，参与讨论并提出至少一条改进建议。",["EN-S1-LA-03.1"],"共同完成学习任务","小组展示中每人至少发言一次并完成一项分工任务。"]]}},{"id":"26cc5462-1c37-dc87-1a32-39c460375f4b","title":"Let's explore","chapters":["Unit 1 I love sports"],"pdf_page":18,"unit_id":"tcu_a39a49e5ed91bbf5","materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.11"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","Ican run fast！ Icanjump high！ I can swim fast！ Ican jump far","book",18],["EN-S1-TH-01.13","P","Find out about an animal sports star.","book",18],["EN-S1-LS-01.16","P","Look at the picture. Find the answers to Activity 1.","book",18]],"goals":{"take":"用 I can... 句型根据图片描述运动能力，查找并用简单句汇报关于动物运动明星的几条信息。","later":"","items":[["学生能查找课文或资料中关于一个动物运动明星的要点，并用1–2句英语向同伴介绍该动物的体育特点。",["EN-S1-TH-01.13","EN-S1-LS-01.16"],"常见的体育运动项目","能用简单句说出该动物的一项运动特长并指出对应图片或事实。"]]}},{"id":"89ed3c88-3bb4-bf01-b70b-0cf5bafee3b1","title":"Unit 3_1 Get ready_1 Listen and sing","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.9","T","Listen and sing","title",null],["EN-S1-LK-01.7","P","clean the table","book",20]],"goals":{"take":"在听、跟唱中演唱本课歌曲，能用动作或图片提示说出目标短语（如 clean the table）。","later":"","items":[["学生能通过听录音并跟唱，完整演唱本课的英语歌曲，注意节奏与主要句子。",["EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"演唱所学的简单英语歌曲","能连贯唱完整首歌，句子语序基本正确，节拍基本一致。"],["学生能根据图片或教师示范，说出并配动作表达课内短语 clean the table。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"说出单词和短语","看到相应图片能正确说出短语并做出相应动作。"]]}},{"id":"0d5cf54e-290d-2b7f-017c-6c6081808682","title":"Unit 2 Helping at home (Get ready)","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.7","T","Learn the words","book",20],["EN-S1-TH-01.5","P","Grandma Grandpa","book",20]],"goals":{"take":"借助图片与示范说出本课家庭成员与日常帮忙的词汇（如 Grandma、Grandpa 等）。","later":"家庭生活的文化比较与延伸活动","items":[["学生能依据图片或实物提示，说出本课所学的单词和短语并与图片配对。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"说出单词和短语","能把听到或看到的词与正确图片配对，口头读出单词。"],["学生能在看图情境中指出并用英语说出 Grandma 和 Grandpa 等家庭成员词汇。",["EN-S1-TH-01.5"],"家庭与家庭生活","指着图片用英语说出相应家庭成员名称（如 Grandma/Grandpa）。"]]}},{"id":"24dd054b-4f41-6c05-1e97-29dbb693b067","title":"Unit 2_1 Get ready_1 Listen and sing","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.9","T","Listen and sing","title",null],["EN-S1-LK-01.7","P","take out the rubbish","book",20]],"goals":{"take":"在听、跟唱中演唱本课歌曲，并能根据图片或动作说出短语 take out the rubbish。","later":"","items":[["学生能通过听录音并跟唱，完整演唱本课的英语歌曲，能跟随节奏念出主要短句。",["EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"演唱所学的简单英语歌曲","能完整唱出歌曲的句子，主要句子发音可辨。"],["学生能根据图片或教师动作，说出并示范短语 take out the rubbish。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"说出单词和短语","看到情境能正确说出短语并做出相关动作。"]]}},{"id":"58c042ab-e2ca-abd3-85b5-82bf8a7cb84f","title":"Unit 2 Helping at home (Start up)","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.6","T","Learn the words","book",20]]},{"id":"13bcae22-846c-07f4-d905-6e612f69096a","title":"Unit 2_2 Start up_1 Read and answer","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-TX-01.2"],"align":[["EN-S1-TX-01.2","T","Can you help me, Bobby！","book",21],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","clean the floor","book",21]]},{"id":"cafd85ea-aa47-5c67-a475-9bd99967a1c9","title":"Unit 2 Helping at home (Speed up)","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Speed up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-TX-01.2"],"align":[["EN-S1-TX-01.2","T","Helping at home (Speed up)","title",null]]},{"id":"fabb6ad6-7c72-9015-0c2f-037b609ba246","title":"Unit 2_3 Speed up_1 Read and answer","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Speed up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Bobby, can you help me clean the floor！","book",21],["EN-S1-TH-01.5","P","This is my family.","book",23],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","Can l make the bed for you, Dad？","book",23]]},{"id":"b672d4d4-fbee-a7f7-23d7-a33a82a0f82b","title":"Unit 2 Helping at home (Fuel up)","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Can you help me clean the floor！","book",21],["EN-S1-TH-01.5","P","This is my family.","book",23],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","May I sweep the floor first？","book",22]]},{"id":"37e67f77-ee4e-e967-62b6-cdfe002de2a8","title":"Unit 2_4 Fuel up_1 Listen and chant","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.2"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.2","T","Which words have “w\" or “y\" sounds？","book",25],["EN-S1-TX-01.1","P","Listen and chant.","book",25]]},{"id":"464b6623-0bc2-786d-9c21-2c3eb8f002d2","title":"Unit 2_4 Fuel up_3 Listen and match","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.3","EN-S1-LS-01.17"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Listen and match.","book",26],["EN-S1-LS-01.17","T","Work in pairs.","book",26]],"goals":{"take":"听辨句子信息并将句子与对应图片匹配；在教师指导下与同伴进行简单角色扮演。","later":"","items":[["学生能听录音并有目的地提取信息，将所听句子与课本图片或选项正确匹配。",["EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"有目的地提取、梳理所需信息","在听后正确配对大多数句子与对应图片（如4／5项）。"],["学生能在教师指导下，与同伴分角色完成简短对话并配合动作表达。",["EN-S1-LS-01.17"],"进行简单的角色扮演","与同伴完成两轮简短对话，语言与动作相对应。"]]}},{"id":"0b207d12-7afe-6cc6-60e7-0ea4e6ca80f6","title":"Unit 2_5 Words and expressions","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Fuel up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.6","T","What do the kids do？","book",26],["EN-S1-LK-01.7","P","feed the pigs","book",26]],"goals":{"take":"借助图片、实物和提示识记并能口头说出本课词汇，能在看图情境中正确指认或复述短语（如feed the pigs）。","later":"","items":[["学生能借助课本图片或实物，在教师出示图片情境时指出并用英语说出本课的动词短语和词汇。",["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"借助图片、实物理解词汇的意思","看到图片能说出或指认相应词汇，如“feed the pigs”。"],["学生能根据图片或教师做的动作等视觉提示，迅速说出或跟读本课短语。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"根据视觉或听觉提示，如图片、动作、动画、声音等，说出单词和短语","听到或看到提示能说出或跟读短语，如播放动作即说“feed the pigs”。"]]}},{"id":"c6e2473f-f7e5-f253-d420-48050c9ae0bb","title":"Unit 2 Helping at home (Hit it big)","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Hit it big"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.11","EN-S1-LS-01.17"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.11","T","What chores can you do？","book",28],["EN-S1-LS-01.17","T","Work in pairs. Ask and answer.","book",28]],"goals":{"take":"在情境对话和配对角色扮演中，使用所学句型询问并回答自己会做的家务，进行简单交流。","later":"更复杂的语法变体和更大范围词汇的灵活运用留到后续课。","items":[["学生能在教师给定的家庭情境中，用所学句型就家务向同伴提问并用完整句回答。",["EN-S1-LK-01.11"],"围绕相关主题，在语境中运用所学语法知识描述人和物，进行简单交流","能问答“What chores can you do?”“I can sweep the floor.”类完整句。"],["学生能在教师指导下与同伴进行简单角色扮演，轮流询问和回应关于做家务的对话。",["EN-S1-LS-01.17"],"在教师指导下进行简单的角色扮演","与同伴完成一段两轮对话并正确轮换角色（问/答）。"]]}},{"id":"8e6da23f-3de0-f5af-d79b-acdf3217e724","title":"Unit 2 Helping at home (Wrap up & Check it & Let's explore)","chapters":["Unit 2 Helping at home","Let's explore"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1},{"id":"3a7609ff-097d-c428-90b2-36575b0724f1","title":"Unit 4_1 Get ready_1 Listen and sing","chapters":["Unit 3 What's the weather like?"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-TX-01.1"],"align":[["EN-S1-TX-01.1","T","Listen and sing","title",null],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","Get ready Learn the words","book",32]],"goals":{"take":"通过听唱和看图，感知并跟唱单元歌曲，借助图片认识本课词汇。","later":"","items":[["学生能在听唱活动中跟唱本课歌曲，能模仿主要节奏与重复句（能连贯唱出一段完整副歌）。",["EN-S1-TX-01.1"],"歌谣、歌曲、韵文","能完整跟唱副歌并模仿节奏与重读词。"],["学生能借助课件或图片识读本课要学的词汇，能用手指指出与图片对应的单词。",["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"借助图片、实物理解词汇的意思","看到图片能迅速指出并说出对应的词（或指出正确图片）。"]]}},{"id":"7180b0c9-f5d8-ffad-3009-d917a1345e1e","title":"Unit 3 What's the weather like (Get ready)","chapters":["Unit 3 What's the weather like?","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.6","T","Get ready Learn the words","book",32],["EN-S1-TH-01.17","P","What's the weather like (Get ready)","title",null]],"goals":{"take":"借助图片掌握本课的天气词汇，并能在简单情境中联系日常生活说出相关活动或衣物。","later":"","items":[["学生能根据教材图片指出并说出本课的天气词汇（如sunny、rainy等），并能用中文或英文指认图片意思。",["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"借助图片、实物理解词汇的意思","看到天气图片能说出相应词并指向图片。"],["学生能在教师提供的日常情境图片中，说出一种与天气相关的日常活动或适合的衣物（用简短词组或句子）。",["EN-S1-TH-01.17"],"天气与日常生活","看活动或着装图片能说出对应的天气与一项适合的活动或衣物。"]]}},{"id":"d0391db5-64a4-3d9f-06e7-4eea3fea3271","title":"Unit 3_1 Get ready_1 Listen and sing","chapters":["Unit 3 What's the weather like?","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-TX-01.1"],"align":[["EN-S1-TX-01.1","T","Listen and sing","title",null],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","Get ready Learn the words","book",32]],"goals":{"take":"通过听唱，感知并跟唱单元歌曲，同时借助图片识记本课词汇。","later":"","items":[["学生能在听唱环节跟唱本课歌曲，模仿句子重音与节奏，能连读并朗诵一段韵文或副歌。",["EN-S1-TX-01.1"],"歌谣、歌曲、韵文","能跟唱并朗读出副歌或一段韵文，重现主要节奏。"],["学生能借助图片识别并说出本课要学的天气词汇，能在配对活动中将词与图正确配对。",["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"借助图片、实物理解词汇的意思","能在配对练习中将每个词与正确图片配对，正确率高。"]]}},{"id":"615ba998-c437-6ef1-356d-5f0a2a771045","title":"Unit 3 What's the weather like (Start up)","chapters":["Unit 3 What's the weather like?","Start up"],