entre hospital supermarket museum","book",68]],"goals":{"take":"借助图片提示，能准确说出本单元常见地点词汇的读法与对应图片（词汇初识与口头输出）。","later":"","items":[["学生能在看图情境中，按教师提示大声说出并指认library、sports centre、hospital、supermarket、museum等地点词汇。",["EN-S1-LK-01.7"],"说出单词和短语","能看到图片后，能用词汇命名并指向对应地点图片，发音基本准确（听得清）。"]]}},{"id":"b0e50b13-2462-5626-0e4d-40735831b70a","title":"Unit 6_1 Get ready_2 Listen, point and say. Then sing","chapters":["Unit 6 Find your way","Get ready"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LS-01.9"],"align":[["EN-S1-LS-01.9","T","Listen, point and say. Then sing","title",null],["EN-S1-LS-01.10","P","The wheels on the bus go round and round.","book",68]],"goals":{"take":"通过听、指认与跟唱，能准确跟读并完整演唱简单儿歌句子，掌握节奏与重复句式。","later":"更复杂的韵律与创编留到后续课。","items":[["学生能在听音频并跟随教师带唱的活动中，大声、连贯地朗读并完整演唱“The wheels on the bus go round and round.”及其重复句。",["EN-S1-LS-01.9","EN-S1-LS-01.10"],"演唱所学的简单英语歌曲","能完整唱出整句并跟上节奏，重要单句不遗漏。"],["学生能在教师播放示范后，边指物边听录音，按示范大声跟读短句并用手指或图片指向相应动作或事物。",["EN-S1-LS-01.10"],"正确朗读学过的对话、故事和文段","在教师示范后能准确跟读并用手势或指图片配合朗读。"]]}},{"id":"749298dd-1312-fdaa-016c-b270dc36ca1e","title":"Unit 6 Find your way (Start up)","chapters":["Unit 6 Find your way","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":["课件","教学设计","学习任务单","课后练习"],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.6"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.6","T","library sports centre hospital supermarket museum","book",68]]},{"id":"0765f1d9-9aa5-4b84-2939-c42b7f62a790","title":"Unit 6_2 Start up_1 Read and answer","chapters":["Unit 6 Find your way","Start up"],"pdf_page":null,"unit_id":null,"materials":[],"hours":1,"ai_points":["EN-S1-LK-01.9","EN-S1-LS-01.3"],"align":[["EN-S1-LK-01.9","T","Susu goes straight on to the museum.","book",69],["EN-S1-LS-01.3","T","Can you tell me the way to the sports centre from the hospit","book",70],["EN-S1-LK-01.6","P","museum library supermarket","book",70]]},{"id":"f6cbd2cb-1f00-9e04-d41c-5f0046614396","title":"Unit 6 Find your way (Speed up)","chapters":["Unit 6 Find your way","Speed up"],"